# 📖 NUCLEUS OPERATIONAL BIBLE
> **Version:** 1.0 (Phase 2/3 Release)
> **Date:** 2026-01-10
> **Scope:** Phase 2 (Cloud Bridge) & Phase 3 (Autonomous Coding)
> **Audience:** Human Operators & AI Agents (Lead Architect, Synthesizer)

---

## 🌌 1. System Overview
**The Nucleus** is a "Dual-Engine" AI operating system designed to automate the lifecycle of software development and business operations.

*   **Engine 1 (Local):** Mac-based CLI, heavy lifting, file system access, git operations.
*   **Engine 2 (Cloud):** Google Cloud Run, 24/7 orchestration, event collection, web dashboard.

This document details exactly how to operate the **Bridge (Phase 2)** and the **Hands (Phase 3)** of this system.

---

## ☁️ 2. Phase 2: Cloud Autonomy (The Bridge)
**Goal:** Run critical infrastructure 24/7 without requiring the local machine to be open, while maintaining a secure link to local operations.

### 2.1 Architecture
*   **Marketing Dashboard:** A lightweight HTML/JS app serving [marketing_log.md](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/docs/marketing/marketing_log.md) and [strategy.md](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/docs/marketing/strategy.md).
    *   **Host:** Cloud Run (`marketing-dashboard` service).
    *   **Auth:** Firebase Authentication (Service Account + ID Tokens).
    *   **Build:** Google Cloud Build (Triggered via [scripts/deploy_dashboard.sh](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/scripts/deploy_dashboard.sh)).
*   **Status Report Tool:** A Python function [brain_synthesize_status_report()](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/capabilities/synthesizer.py#29-137) that generates a "State of the Union".
    *   **Input:** [task.md](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/7c654df4-b83e-43f9-8620-f15868ec39d1/task.md), [NUCLEUS_VISION.md](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/7c654df4-b83e-43f9-8620-f15868ec39d1/NUCLEUS_VISION.md), logs, cron schedule.
    *   **Output:** Markdown roadmap with emoji-coded status.

### 2.2 Deployment Protocol
To deploy changes to the Cloud Dashboard:

1.  **Verify Project ID:**
    ```bash
    gcloud config get-value project
    # Must match: gen-lang-client-0894185576
    ```
2.  **Execute Deployment Script:**
    ```bash
    ./scripts/deploy_dashboard.sh
    ```
    *   *Mechanism:* Uses [cloudbuild_dashboard.yaml](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/cloudbuild_dashboard.yaml) to build a Docker image and push to GCR.
    *   *Dynamic Config:* The script automatically injects the active `${PROJECT_ID}`.

### 2.3 Troubleshooting Log (Artifacts of War)
During implementation, we encountered and solved the following roadblocks:

| Roadblock | Symptom | Solution (The Fix) |
|-----------|---------|--------------------|
| **Hardcoded Project ID** | Build failure: `denied: Artifact Registry API...` | **Fix:** Replaced hardcoded string with dynamic `$(gcloud config get-value project)` in [deploy_dashboard.sh](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/scripts/deploy_dashboard.sh) and `${PROJECT_ID}` substitution in [cloudbuild_dashboard.yaml](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/cloudbuild_dashboard.yaml). |
| **Missing Build Context** | Docker error: `COPY docs/marketing/ failed` | **Fix:** Removed `docs/` from [.gcloudignore](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/.gcloudignore) to allow upload of static markdown files. |
| **FastMCP Missing** | Runtime Warning in logs | **Fix:** System degrades gracefully to "Standalone Mode" (Standard Lib only) as designed. No action needed. |
| **Missing Vision File** | Status Report failed: `NUCLEUS_VISION.md not found` | **Fix:** Copied master vision file from `.gemini/antigravity/...` to local `.brain/` folder. |
| **Missing Tools** | `Nightly Agent` failed | **Fix:** Installed `ripgrep` (`brew install ripgrep`) and `python-telegram-bot`. |

